        {"zh": "身量非常之大", "en": "Very large."},
        {"zh": "我露出一截背", "en": "Part of my back breaks surface."},
        {"zh": "转身沉了回去", "en": "I turn and sink back."},
        {"zh": "竹林边上很安静", "en": "Quiet by the bamboo."},
        {"zh": "我喜欢这样的水", "en": "I like water like this."},
        {"zh": "泥底，水草多", "en": "Muddy bottom, plenty of weeds."},
        {"zh": "底下趴着螺蛳", "en": "Snails cling to the bottom."},
        {"zh": "我先找了一圈", "en": "I take a first circuit."},
        {"zh": "然后停在深处", "en": "Then settle in the deep."}
      ]
    },
